msgctxt "84_Martial Arts Fan"
msgid "You know that guy over at the Shichifuku Parking Lot?"
msgstr "¿Conoces a ese tipo en el estacionamiento de Shichifuku?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=1
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P1
#. y4:msg_speaker=Businesswoman
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "96_Businesswoman"
msgid "Nope. What guy?"
msgstr "No. ¿Qué tipo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=2
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P2
#. y4:msg_speaker=Martial Arts Fan
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "108_Martial Arts Fan"
msgid "There's this guy who pays people prize money if they can hit him. He pops up in Kamurocho from time to time."
msgstr "Hay un tipo que le paga a la gente el dinero del premio si pueden golpearlo. Aparece en Kamurocho de vez en cuando."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "120_Businesswoman"
msgid "Really? You should give it a try. I mean, you're\\r\nalways talking about how good you are at all\\r\nthat mixed martial arts stuff."
msgstr "¿Enserio? Deberías intentarlo. Es decir, eres\\r\nsiempre hablando de lo bueno que eres en todo\\r\neso de las artes marciales mixtas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "132_Martial Arts Fan"
msgid "Are you kidding me? No way! The dude's got\\r\ninsane footwork. No one ever lands a punch!"
msgstr "¿Estás bromeando? ¡No es posible! El tío tiene\\r\nun juego de pies loco. ¡Nadie da un puñetazo!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "144_Martial Arts Fan"
msgid "I watched a half dozen guys take him on, and not\\r\none even managed to graze him."
msgstr "Vi a media docena de chicos enfrentarse a él, y ni\\r\nuno incluso logró rozarlo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "156_Businesswoman"
msgid "That is impressive! I think I'll go see him in\\r\naction later."
msgstr "¡Eso es impresionante! Creo que iré a verlo\\r\nen accion despues."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "168_Martial Arts Fan"
msgid "Yeah, you really should. The parking lot he's in\\r\nis over by that one yakiniku restaurant."
msgstr "Sí, realmente deberías. El estacionamiento en el que está\\r\nestá por ese restaurante yakiniku."
